---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Read how The Elite Spa Centre protects your privacy during WhatsApp reservations and local wellness shop basket sessions."
>
  <main class="pt-36 pb-24 sm:pt-44 sm:pb-28 max-w-3xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8 space-y-8">
    <h1 class="font-serif text-[44px] sm:text-[56px] text-[#F5F5F0]">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <div class="space-y-5 text-[18px] text-[#F5F5F0]/90 leading-[1.65]">
      <p>Reservation forms and ritual builders on this website operate directly in your browser and hand off your selected preferences to WhatsApp so our Kalyani Nagar concierge can confirm your suite immediately. We do not store personal booking form submissions on external third-party servers.</p>
      <p>Your Wellness Apothecary basket is saved locally inside your browser storage for convenience between visits and can be cleared at any time using the Clear button on the Shop page.</p>
      <p>Messages sent via WhatsApp or phone are used exclusively by The Elite Spa Centre concierge team to coordinate your spa appointment or apothecary order.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</Base>
